# PLAN-1080 — AV 调用绑定、隐式函数签名与管道（语言共享语料 calls 面）

The canonical author of the call/binding/pipeline language family. Every
case carries ONE Auto source; the `av` check runs the ordinary AV language
chain (`ac-av/language-source-run-v1`); ac-native and legacy-reference
checks keep their original oracles and owners with the AV-phase `#ignore`
marker (AV-ONLY-1078-1096) — not executed in this phase, never blocking
the AV gate; their backend tasks remove the marker when they land.

Legacy migration rows (old case ids / oracles / source SHA16) live in
`language/migration/legacy-map.tsv`; the `double`→`twice` rename of
legacy.09_functions.006 is the one auditable normalization (the legacy
identifier is a reserved numeric type word in the current language —
fn-local-var keeps the original semantics and oracle).

## Case: pipe-method-and-field
id: "av.parity.1080.pipe-method-and-field"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1080", "calls"]
links: ["PLAN-1080"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
type P {
 v int
 fn add(n int) P { return P(.v + n) }
}
fn main() int {
 let p = P(19)
 let q = p |> .add(20)
            |> .add(3)
 return q |> .v
}
```

### Probe av
recipe: "ac-av/language-source-run-v1"
entry: "d_main"
caps: ["ac.source.language.av/v1", "console.stdout", "console.stderr"]
exit: 42

### Probe a2r
recipe: "ac-a2r/hir-language-run-v1"
profile: "language"
entry: "main"
caps: ["ac.source.language.av/v1"]
exit: 0

#### stdout

```text
value:42
```

### Probe ac-native
#ignore
recipe: "ac/mir-native-scalar-v1"
entry: "d_main"
exit: 42

### Notes

The pipe three-form contract: `x |> .m(args)` method call, multi-line
`|>` continuation (line-start pipe), `x |> .field` projection. The
receiver and every argument are evaluated exactly once (single desugared
method call — no second parser, no AST addition).

